	"_about": "Golden quotes recorded from the legacy Nuxt 2 storefront (develop @ a3831ab). The v2 quote engine must reproduce every entry in `quotes` exactly, in cents (backend/tests/Feature/Pricing/GoldenQuotesTest.php).",
	"captured": "2026-10-17",
	"method": "Each quote loads its page fresh, sets the inputs through the same component setters the UI uses (Current, Desired, Slider, Checkout), calls the page's own changePrice(), and reads the Vuex getter price/price. Calling changePrice() directly matters: some pages never re-price when an input changes (see docs/domain.md).",
	"formula": "price = base_price * amount * (1 + percent / 100), where base_price comes from the page changePrice() and percent is the sum of the checked options. The order was charged in EUR as round(price * 100) cents; the checkout displayed the same number as USD next to a converted EUR amount.",
	"rounding": "cents = round half up of price * 100 (PHP round()). Several prices land on half a cent, e.g. 201.375.",
